Description:

JMAP Email Delivery Push Notifications (draft-ietf-jmap-emailpush) in the
user's own account.  PushSubscription gains the emailPush and emailCount
properties, and lmtpd evaluates each subscription's EmailPush filter when it
delivers a message, reporting the matches as an EmailPush event for the
notification service to send.


Documentation:

docsrc/rfc-support.rst


Config changes:

New `jmap_emailpush` switch, off by default.


Upgrade instructions:

Enable `jmap_emailpush` only once the notification service that handles
PushSubscriptionCreated events also handles EmailPush events, and tracks
mailbox counts for EmailCount.


GitHub issue:

None.
